flowchart TD
    A[Start: Hospital System] --> B[Show Welcome Message]
    B --> C[Show Loading Screen]
    C --> D{Main Menu}
    
    D -->|Option 1| E[Show Diagram & Add Patient]
    D -->|Option 2| F[Show Diagram & Discharge Patient]
    D -->|Option 3| G[Check Room Availability]
    D -->|Option 4| H[Check if Patient is Admitted]
    D -->|Option 5| I[Search Patient Details]
    D -->|Option 6| J[Print All Patient Records]
    D -->|Option 7| K[Exit System]
    
    E --> D
    F --> D
    G --> D
    H --> D
    I --> D
    J --> D
    
    K --> L[End]
    
    subgraph E [Add Patient]
        E1[Select Room]
        E2{Is Room Free?}
        E1 --> E2
        E2 -->|Yes| E3[Enter Patient Data]
        E2 -->|No| E4[Show Error & Retry]
        E4 --> E1
        E3 --> E5[Return to Menu]
    end

    subgraph F [Discharge Patient]
        F1[Select Room]
        F2[Clear All Patient Data]
        F1 --> F2 --> F3[Return to Menu]
    end

    subgraph G [Check Availability]
        G1[Update Room Status]
        G2[Display Available/Occupied Rooms]
        G1 --> G2 --> G3[Return to Menu]
    end

    subgraph H [Check Admission]
        H1[Enter Patient Name]
        H2[Search in Records]
        H3{Found?}
        H2 --> H3
        H3 -->|Yes| H4[Show Room Number]
        H3 -->|No| H5[Show Not Found]
        H4 --> H6[Return to Menu]
        H5 --> H6
    end

    subgraph I [Search Patient]
        I1[Enter Patient Name]
        I2[Search in Records]
        I3{Found?}
        I2 --> I3
        I3 -->|Yes| I4[Display All Patient Info]
        I3 -->|No| I5[Show Not Found]
        I4 --> I6[Return to Menu]
        I5 --> I6
    end

    subgraph J [Print All Records]
        J1[Loop Through All Rooms]
        J2[Display Patient Info for Each]
        J1 --> J2 --> J3[Return to Menu]
    end